# The WP-7b surface lane's baselines enumerate API routes and file paths
# from PRIVATE repos (ciphex-alpha-dashboard, atlas, abacus-trading-view).
# This lane is a manually-invoked local CLI (`python -m drift_monitor.surface`)
# never read by the deployed Railway service (see drift_monitor/main.py and
# drift_monitor/railway.json -- neither references drift_monitor/surface.py),
# so these baselines do not need to be committed to a now-public repo. Kept
# on disk locally; regenerate with `--accept` against a local checkout when
# needed (see surface.py's module docstring).
surface/*.json
